From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:28:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/35] feat(look): -MageArenaS1Shot, the push's S1 yardstick
 capture

A deterministic still of key art S1 under any -MageArenaLook=: the Brennic
semifinal frozen at once, Brennic on the seat's forward line at his own
bout-start distance in his Cast clip (paused), one of his Fire bolts 3.2 m
out, the player's ward raised through the hand pipeline. Writes s1-game.png
(layout FOV) and s1-keyart.png (narrower FOV, Brennic at half the frame
height) at 1376x768, plus manifest.json. apps/vr/tools/capture-s1.ps1
-Look flat|quest|epic -Out <dir> runs it rendered and fails on a missing file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
