From be533fd3dfcbe2c76b0e707feae5c31bb9a9c8b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:46:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/35] feat(look): quest look v1, textured lit arena, painted
 sky, sun and grade

Only under -MageArenaLook=quest (flat is unchanged, suite 345/348 with the
three known Lynx reds). Look/QuestLook: world-aligned textured materials on
the greybox shapes (wall, stands, sand, dais, pads, seats, iron, wood),
contact darkening in the shader, an unlit painted sky dome with a sky light
captured from it, one shadowed sun (2 cascades, VSM off so the desktop proxy
draws CSM like Quest), four unshadowed brazier point lights, light haze,
filmic tonemapper with fixed exposure and modest bloom. Dressing: red/gold
banners on the wall and poles, a flagstone lip on the dais edge, four stone
pylons with fire bowls. The crowd tints take a x3 gain. Assets are built
headless by Look/CreateQuestLookAssetsCommandlet
(apps/vr/tools/look/create-quest-look-assets.ps1). D-G4 stress, quest look:
draw calls median 137 (p95 141), BasePass 146k tris.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
