From 4659d37e2e73c5eaccfb85a69ffd00caa30244c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:34:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/35] feat(art): Brennic epic texture set on his own UVs,
 face and finish, M_BrennicEpic

A texture-space finish of the committed SK_Brennic (DINOv3 bake LOD0, ad38b9b): no geometry,
rig or clip change, so the flat look is untouched. apps/vr/art/characters/brennic/epic/:
face_overlay.py paints the face (eyes, lash lines, scowling brow, mouth) in a front-ortho head
frame, bake_epic.py projects it into the albedo with Cycles and builds region masks (tunic,
skin, iron collar, bronze brooch, hair, leather, cloak) for a regraded albedo, a DirectX
normal (hair curls, wool weave, folds) and ORM (AO, roughness, metallic, skin mask), 2048.
-run=CreateBrennicEpic imports them into /Game/Look/Epic/Brennic with a subsurface-profile
skin material; BrennicEpicLook::ApplyAll swaps it onto every SK_Brennic in a world.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
