From 43218936d178cbaa1cc46d6bbc5261df4db4003c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:19:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/35] feat(look): painted spell VFX on every non-flat look,
 fireball, water ward, cast flames

Look/QuestSpells, Quest-viable and shared by the quest and epic looks (flat
unchanged): M_Q_SpellGlow replaces M_SpellGlow for every puff (same T63 cells
and custom data, studio fireball and water splash in the shell cells, an HDR
white-gold heart for warm colours only, none on the unblockable's SoftGlow);
M_Q_BoltCore gives a glowing bolt's core a moving fire pattern in its own
threat colour (a black core stays black); the raised ward is a turquoise
water wave panning on 14 cards round the palm (one instanced draw); Brennic's
Cast shows flames at his hands in his glow colour. The D-G4 census plans the
new core material. Assets: -run=CreateQuestSpellAssets
(apps/vr/tools/look/create-quest-spell-assets.ps1) from
apps/vr/art/look/spells (prep_spell_textures.py, three studio stills).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
