From fcd0865addab3bf98187a44e9c2efdbaca7138b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:38:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/35] feat(look): licking env fire, bolt trail and halo,
 rune-flame Wardstones, two-wave ward

Shared by the quest and epic looks (flat unchanged). M_Q_EnvFire: a painted
tall flame (studio still), additive, its UV swaying toward the tips and
flickering per card; M_Q_SpellHalo: a soft additive glow card, the glow Quest
has without bloom. A glowing bolt gets a halo in its own colour (never the
unblockable) and a fire bolt a three-card flame trail; the atlas is 2048 BC7
so a bolt near the eye stays smooth. The carved Wardstones' cap is a small
crystal under a rune flame and halo in the Tithe colour, still the signal.
The ward pans over two different wave stills (no mirrored repeat) and thins
toward the palm so the sand shows through.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
