+/**
+ * The painted crowd under the non-flat looks (graphics push 10-28, shared asset; flat keeps the T57/T65 clay cards and
+ * their tint tests). T_CrowdPainted (apps/vr/art/crowd-painted/pack_crowd.py, two studio stills of colourful cheering
