From a44aec856c48822406dd979e665c8b7ea2875c43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:55:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/35] feat(look): quest look r4, tanned hand skin, hazed sky,
 darker cooler wall

Quest look only. M_Q_Hands on Tier B's SK_PlayerHands skin slots: the albedo
itself was near white-pink (sRGB ~230, 200, 180; the sun is the one the sand
reads right under), so the quest skin tans it, keeps its regional tones,
pinks knuckles and tips, adds a cheap warm wrap, roughness 0.5. The sky's
bottom fades into a warm haze (no dark band over the stands) and the sun disc
softens to a glow. Grade notch: wall darker and cooler, sand and sky less
saturated, paler sun.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
