From f5f5be21ea0564d029d6627c2dd2779c76379723 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:14:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/35] feat(look): quest look r5, dark gate behind Brennic,
 mobile LDR exposure, grade

Quest look only. A dark recessed gate under a stone lintel in the far wall
straight behind Brennic, so his figure stands against shadow; his rim doubled.
With MobileHDR off (no post pass) the lights carry the exposure (x0.78), which
brings the mobile LDR proxy's sand back from value 0.93 to 0.84 (desktop
0.77). Grade: sand, wall and sky less saturated and redder; hand tint a notch
under Tier B's 815911f tan (S1's hands are darker), no double tan.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
