From 7025fd1cbd2c5cb05e8074fb5bbc6a20250bc8fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:13:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 22/35] feat(look): styled wrist cuff and rune-strip bars under
 the non-flat looks

The cuff keeps its place, its masks and its four bars with their meaning (HP magenta, mana
blue, stamina green, clock gold); only the drawing changes off flat. The panel draws through
M_CuffStyled (a bronze frame round the plane's edge, the mask's icons warmed and softened,
60 % cover instead of the pass-through's full cover) and each bar through M_CuffRune, a slim
glowing strip in a softer, desaturated version of its own hue (CuffLook::Soften).
-run=CreateCuffStyled builds both in /Game/Look/Shared/Cuff. The crowd placeholder band shows
off flat only while it swells on a break (the signal kept), since the painted crowd is there.
No gameplay change; flat unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
