+ * The wrist cuff's styled presentation under the non-flat looks (graphics push 10-28, shared; flat keeps the debug-plain
+ * cuff). Same place, same masks, same bars and their meaning (HP magenta, mana blue, stamina green, clock gold): the
+ * panel draws through M_CuffStyled (a bronze frame round the edge, the mask's icons softened and warmed, less opaque),
+ * and each bar is a slim glowing rune strip (M_CuffRune) in a softer, desaturated version of its own hue.
+ * Tools/CreateCuffStyledCommandlet builds both in /Game/Look/Shared/Cuff.
+ */
+namespace CuffLook
