Shared (flat unchanged). From its settle on, the S1 shot holds the world's
game time (the materials' Time: ward pan, flame lick) and the presentation's
clock (QuestSpells::Clock: flipbook cells) at 12.5 s (-MageArenaS1ClockS=),
