on average. The ward's cards now stand upright edge to edge and M_Q_Ward lifts
the wave inside them along the arch curve, so the wedge gaps Tier B found at
the ribbon's base are gone, still one instanced draw. The Wardstones' rune
flames and halos are larger so the Tithe cap reads at distance.

