From 1ffc4b1ed33a9f188b5a480c90e39a8bff5fef74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:21:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 27/35] feat(look): cuff bars as flat glowing rune lines facing
 the eye

Off flat, each cuff bar is now the engine plane turned to face the camera with its length
across the view (the cuff's Fit still sets that length each frame, at the same anchor), drawn
by M_CuffRune as an additive line that glows along its middle and fades at its ends, instead
of a box receding along the view. Same meaning, hues (softened) and places; flat unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
