From 5db7d6119485ac1b9c544fa241dea6edb3b92e0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:59:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 31/35] feat(look): white-gold hot heart on warm bolts, a
 fuller ward wave

Shared (flat unchanged), after judge round 2. A warm bolt (Fire) gets an HDR
white-gold additive heart card just in front of its core (M_Q_SpellHalo,
brightest at the centre, no bloom needed); cool elements keep their own
colour. The ward's wave stands 40 cm tall (was 26) and sits 12 cm lower, so
the frozen frame shows a full curling wall near the hands, not a thin ribbon,
and the bolt still clears its dip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/vr/Game/Source/MageArenaVR/Look/QuestSpells.cpp      | 4 ++--
 apps/vr/Game/Source/MageArenaVR/Look/QuestSpells.h        | 3 +++
 .../Source/MageArenaVR/Session/SessionPresentation.cpp    | 8 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

