Subject: [PATCH 35/35] fix(look): quest r9, hand skin toward S1, no sky
 recapture once play runs

Quest look only. The hand tint drops to 0.36/0.27/0.28: the hand backs read
sRGB ~167, 89, 66 (mobile LDR 181, 100, 81) against S1's ~145, 91, 74 (r8:
213, 138, 98). The sky light recaptures at 2 and 6 s only: each recapture
redraws the scene into six cube faces, and the 15 s one was the single
~980-draw outlier frame in the r7 and r8 D-G4 runs (r9 max 144).

